    <imageSet>
        <name>Unaligned multi-frame micrographs of SARS-CoV-2 5' stem-loops 5-6 with SL5c extended RNA.</name>
        <directory>/data/SARS-CoV-2_SL5-6_5cext/exposures</directory>
        <category>micrographs - multiframe</category>
        <headerFormat>TIFF</headerFormat>
        <dataFormat>TIFF</dataFormat>
        <numImagesOrTiltSeries>5880</numImagesOrTiltSeries>
        <framesPerImage>41</framesPerImage>
        <voxelType>UNSIGNED BYTE</voxelType>
        <dimensions>
            <imageWidth>5760</imageWidth>
            <pixelWidth>0.68</pixelWidth>
            <imageHeight>4092</imageHeight>
            <pixelHeight>0.68</pixelHeight>
        </dimensions>
        <details>These micrographs were collected with a Titan Krios G3i, 300kV, using a BioQuantum energy filter with slit size 20eV, and a K3 detector. Over the collection, the sample was exposed evenly to 50 electrons per angstrom squared with a total exposure time of 1.19 seconds. Desired defocuses ranged from -1 to -2 nm. The exposures are not gain corrected, the gain reference can be found at data/SARS-CoV-2_SL5-6_5cext/exposures/K3-18210041 Gain Ref. x1.m1.mrc.</details>
        <segmentationList/>
        <micrographsFilePattern>data/SARS-CoV-2_SL5-6_5cext/exposures/GridSquare_*/FoilHole_*_fractions.tiff</micrographsFilePattern>
